<title>USA: Omaha Public's Ft Calhoun power plant at 51 pct.</title>
<headline>Omaha Public's Ft Calhoun power plant at 51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omaha Public Power District's Fort Calhoun nuclear power plant is currently producing at 51 percent of its rated 478 megawatt (MW) capacity, Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said Thursday.</p>
<p>The unit was shut Dec 31 due to a main steam leak, NRC said in its daily plant status report. It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>The unit is in Fort Calhoun, Neb.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk 1 212 859 1628))</p>
